# Editor state is local, with one exception: the per-milestone build
# plans are real design history that ROADMAP.md cites, so they travel
# with the repository. Rules under .cursor/rules/ stay local, because
# the canonical contract is AGENTS.md and TIGERSTYLE.md.
.cursor/*
!.cursor/plans/
.venv
.venv-dgemma
.venv-ar
data/
archive/
results/
transcripts/
*__pycache__/
*.pyc
